22
00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:52.710
Yes.
是的。

23
00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:53.150
Yeah.
是啊。

24
00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:55.970
I mean, he started skating professionally when he was just 14.
我的意思是，他14岁就开始进行职业滑板运动了。

25
00:00:56.590 --> 00:00:58.770
He is a pioneer of the sport.
他是这项运动的先驱。

26
