He helped popularize and evolve the sport of skateboarding for like over 40 years.
在过去的40多年里，他一直在帮助普及和发展滑板运动。

27
00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:05.850
And he's still skateboarding today.
而且他今天仍在玩滑板。

28
00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:06.410
Yes.
是的。

29
00:01:06.770 --> 00:01:07.050
Yeah.
是啊。

30
00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:10.910
