00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:13.610
Camera balls on me, please.
请给我安排上摄像球。

125
00:05:13.610 --> 00:05:14.610
And a fantasy film, please.
还有拍一部奇幻电影，拜托。

126
00:05:15.110 --> 00:05:15.910
Putting it out there.
说出我们的愿望。

127
00:05:15.970 --> 00:05:16.650
Putting it out there.
说出我们的愿望。

128
00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:19.150
Well, you know, my sons know about this game.
嗯，你知道的，我儿子们都知道这款游戏。

129
00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:21.670
They're very excited about the new version coming out.
他们对即将推出的新版本感到非常兴奋。

130
00:05:22.230 --> 00:05:26.630
And Tony shared with us a little bit about just the music that's part of it.
托尼跟我们分享了一点关于游戏里包含的音乐的事情。

131
00:05:26.670 --> 00:05:26.850
Oh, yeah.
哦，对。

