他就说，安吉拉，这是一部非常棒的纪录片。

145
00:06:04.570 --> 00:06:05.610
You've got to watch it.
你一定要看。

146
00:06:06.210 --> 00:06:10.250
And there's also just so much footage of Tony growing up.
